  <item>
    <title>EP05 解构家常菜：辣椒炒肉</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/64436a884ab44bb08d6b31f4</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">64436a884ab44bb08d6b31f4</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 22 Apr 2023 04:57:29 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>相信科学，享受生活。由建筑师、视频博主、野生厨师杨光和音乐 DJ 方舟为您带来的《光顾着吃》。</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期节目配合杨光近期发布的视频：</span><a href="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1Ps4y1U7f2/" data-url="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1Ps4y1U7f2/"><span>如何做出肉片不柴、清爽不腻、鲜香下饭的辣椒炒肉</span></a><span>。</span></p><span></span><p><span>在调研、体验并做完视频之后，杨光意犹未尽地请到好朋友，北京渔芙南餐厅的创始人左太明，围绕辣椒炒肉这道菜又展开聊了聊。</span></p><span></span><p><span>主持/选题/设计：杨光</span><br><span>制作：方舟</span><br><span>本期嘉宾：左太明，渔芙南餐厅创始人</span></p><span></span><p><span>Show Notes:</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="83">01:23</a> 杨光介绍新节目系列“解构家常菜”与嘉宾左太明；</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="374">06:14</a> 湖南人下馆子到底吃不吃辣椒炒肉？费大厨用了什么“神秘”辅料？</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="823">13:43</a> 湘菜馆的“辣度军备竞赛”；</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1578">26:18</a> 社畜的一天，总想以重口味结束。</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1903">31:43</a> 本地辣椒重要吗？“虎皮”、干煸辣椒…这些做法真的好吗？</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2949">49:09</a> 为什么大家执着于讲辣椒的故事，但对猪肉一带而过？</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3347">55:47</a> 猪肉的肥瘦比例，以及刀工不好怎么办？<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3648">01:00:48</a> 食材下锅顺序，蒜，豆豉还是酱油？左老板和他最爱的家乡菜，活水煮活鱼。</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4198">01:09:58</a> 湘菜小炒放糖吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span>看看</span><strong><span>杨光还做了什么吃的</span></strong><span>：</span><a href="https://space.bilibili.com/21950148" data-url="https://space.bilibili.com/21950148"><span>B站</span></a><span> </span><a href="https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCIB6FxDn7muqNdIIT3_nMXg/" data-url="https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCIB6FxDn7muqNdIIT3_nMXg/"><span>油管</span></a><span> 以及各大视频平台搜索“杨光_建厨师”；</span></p><span></span><p><span>听听</span><strong><span>方舟挑选的冷门音乐</span></strong><span>：</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/5f14330f6d7660742733a686?s=eyJ1IjogIjVlN2M2ZTRiYTJmMmU1MDNjZWMzOGJhYiJ9" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/5f14330f6d7660742733a686?s=eyJ1IjogIjVlN2M2ZTRiYTJmMmU1MDNjZWMzOGJhYiJ9"><span>小宇宙</span></a><span> </span><a href="https://music.163.com/radio/?id=794954379&amp;userid=284135502" data-url="https://music.163.com/radio/?id=794954379&amp;userid=284135502"><span>网易云</span></a><span> 以及各大播客平台搜索“周末变奏”；</span></p>]]></description>
