  <item>
    <title>EP02 北京烤鸭红黑榜，有的真让人大跌眼镜</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/612c9984a90aa541d58e0fbd</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">612c9984a90aa541d58e0fbd</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 30 Aug 2021 08:36:01 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>相信科学，享受生活。由建筑师、视频博主、野生厨师</span><strong><span>杨光</span></strong><span>和音乐 DJ </span><strong><span>方舟</span></strong><span>为您带来的《光顾着吃》，本期节目话题继续停留在</span><strong><span>北京烤鸭</span></strong><span>身上。杨光与嘉宾、知名美食博主</span><strong><span>雨前羽街</span></strong><span>摩拳擦掌，对北京的各档各家烤鸭店一一点评，我们书接前文，为您带来又吹又黑的</span><strong><span>北京烤鸭红黑榜</span></strong><span>！如果想在北京吃到一顿不踩雷的烤鸭，相信你可以在本期节目中找到适合自己的参考。</span></p><span></span><p><span>PS: 本期节目比预计推迟上线了几天，皆因为在某一家烤鸭店里发生了一些意外…不吐不快的事情，我们加更在节目最后了。节目略长，欢迎参考 Show Notes 各取所需:)</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>Show Notes:</span></strong><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="77">01:17</a> 为什么说烤鸭是一道拼服务的菜？配料，饼，各元素的配合，以及正确的上菜顺序；</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="377">06:17</a> 鸭架怎么做，是店家与客人间一种“试探”；</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="802">13:22</a> 在烤鸭店，还能点些什么别的菜？</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1193">19:53</a> 点评开始！首先迎来老字号组：<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1249">20:49</a> 全聚德，<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1432">23:52</a> 便宜坊，<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1528">25:28</a> 利群；</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1778">29:38</a> 高端餐饮组：大董、晟永兴、1949全鸭季、拾久；</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1917">31:57</a> 小贴士：高级中餐厅酒单也许有惊喜哦；</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2216">36:56</a> 平价组：小大董、四季民福、峨眉酒家、花家怡园、玉林…</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2440">40:40</a> 酒店组：长安壹号（东方君悦）、京雅堂（瑜舍）、乡味小厨（瑰丽）、海天阁（嘉里大酒店）;</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2731">45:31</a> 小知识：酒店餐厅为何常有烤鸭？</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2817">46:57</a> 最期待尝试组：新荣记（新源里店）、晟永兴（上海店）；冰窖、翰林书院;</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3419">56:59</a> 烤鸭中的个人化因素，会影响烤鸭的发展吗？</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3705">01:01:45</a> 一些在结尾时会说的话；</span></p><span></span><p><span>...</span><br><span>...</span><br><span>...</span></p><span></span><p><span href="#t=01:04:42"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3882">01:04:42</a></span></span><span> 突然的</span><strong><span>返场</span></strong><span>：关于一家店，我们不吐不快啊…</span></p><span></span><p><span>主持/选题/设计：杨光</span><br><span>主持/录音/制作：方舟</span><br><span>本期嘉宾：雨前羽街（知名美食博主）</span></p><span></span><p><span>你喜欢的烤鸭是什么样的？有没有推荐朋友的必去烤鸭店？还想听我们聊些什么美食？欢迎在评论区留言。</span></p><span></span><p><span>杨光与朋友们连吃五只烤鸭的</span><strong><span>探店视频</span></strong><span>在这里：</span><a href="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1ub4y1S7iS" data-url="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1ub4y1S7iS"><span>烤鸭也能像算法一样迭代吗？</span></a><span> 你也可以通过以下方式“捕捉”到我们：</span></p><span></span><p><span>微博：</span><a href="https://weibo.com/p/1005051362772654" data-url="https://weibo.com/p/1005051362772654"><span>@杨光_建厨师</span></a><span> </span><a href="https://weibo.com/p/1005053977660838" data-url="https://weibo.com/p/1005053977660838"><span>@线性方舟</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>看看</span><strong><span>杨光还做了什么吃的</span></strong><span>：</span><a href="https://space.bilibili.com/21950148" data-url="https://space.bilibili.com/21950148"><span>B站</span></a><span> </span><a href="https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCIB6FxDn7muqNdIIT3_nMXg/" data-url="https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCIB6FxDn7muqNdIIT3_nMXg/"><span>油管</span></a><span> 以及各大视频平台搜索“杨光_建厨师”；</span></p><span></span><p><span>听听</span><strong><span>方舟挑选的冷门音乐</span></strong><span>：</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/5f14330f6d7660742733a686?s=eyJ1IjogIjVlN2M2ZTRiYTJmMmU1MDNjZWMzOGJhYiJ9" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/5f14330f6d7660742733a686?s=eyJ1IjogIjVlN2M2ZTRiYTJmMmU1MDNjZWMzOGJhYiJ9"><span>小宇宙</span></a><span> </span><a href="https://music.163.com/radio/?id=794954379&amp;userid=284135502" data-url="https://music.163.com/radio/?id=794954379&amp;userid=284135502"><span>网易云</span></a><span> 以及各大播客平台搜索“周末变奏”；</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期嘉宾 </span><strong><span>雨前羽街</span></strong><span>：播客 </span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/5f292c4e9504bbdb771df09b?s=eyJ1IjogIjVlN2M2ZTRiYTJmMmU1MDNjZWMzOGJhYiJ9" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/5f292c4e9504bbdb771df09b?s=eyJ1IjogIjVlN2M2ZTRiYTJmMmU1MDNjZWMzOGJhYiJ9"><span>《饭不着》</span></a><span> 微博 </span><a href="https://weibo.com/p/1005051920022547" data-url="https://weibo.com/p/1005051920022547"><span>@雨前羽街</span></a></p>]]></description>
