    <title>EP01 当我们吃烤鸭时，我们在吃什么</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/611b74fd4f9fa4cdff46973d</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">611b74fd4f9fa4cdff46973d</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 17 Aug 2021 08:33:57 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>建筑师、视频博主、鸡尾酒爱好者、野生厨师</span><strong><span>杨光</span></strong><span>，和本行是电台音乐 DJ 的</span><strong><span>方舟</span></strong><span>，一起开启这档关于食物的播客《光顾着吃》。</span></p><span></span><p><span>这是杨光的同名探店系列视频节目的延伸，也是一个与爱吃、能吃、讲究吃的好朋友聊天的自留地。开启节目的第一个话题，正是杨光、方舟与朋友们最近反复品味的——北京烤鸭。</span></p><span></span><p><span>同样钟爱烤鸭的美食博主</span><strong><span>雨前羽街</span></strong><span>做客，在这期节目中与杨光从烤鸭的各种历史传说，一直聊到用餐习惯与各路趣闻。北京烤鸭和南京有何联系？全聚德和便宜坊是什么关系？烤鸭配料有什么讲究？大董做出了什么贡献？作为北京这片公认的美食荒漠中珍稀的代表，烤鸭不止是旅游纪念品那么简单。</span></p><span></span><p><img src="https://i.typlog.com/chefitect-yang/8370801815_889557.jpg" alt="光顾着吃 工作照.jpg"><br><span>下期节目，杨光和雨前羽街还将分门别类、逐家盘点北京的高中低档烤鸭店。敬请期待又吹又黑的《光顾着吃》北京烤鸭红黑榜！</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>Show Notes:</span></strong><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> 启动!《光顾着吃》的缘起；</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="159">02:39</a> 现在是讨论北京烤鸭的好时候；介绍嘉宾雨前羽街；</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="349">05:49</a> 北京烤鸭是从南京来的？几种民间传说；</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="824">13:44</a> 大董把北京的鸭种带到纽约开店，然而…</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="903">15:03</a> 烤鸭属于 fusion 菜？食物考据之难；</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1153">19:13</a> 焖炉与挂炉有啥区别？有些传统，需要更新了；</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1424">23:44</a> 配料中的妖艳贱货，以及如何才算改良烤鸭？</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1979">32:59</a> 如何吃烤鸭：卷鸭饼也有通行标准吗？</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2165">36:05</a> 饼的品质也是容易忽视的地方；</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2426">40:26</a> 讲究的朋友，愿意为一只烤鸭等80分钟；</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2515">41:55</a> 飘忽不定的大董“酥不腻5.0”；</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2675">44:35</a> 大董 vs 梁文道：烤鸭的仪式感与怀旧；</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2894">48:14</a> 烤箱、片盘、5.0：大董对烤鸭改良做出的贡献；</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3240">54:00</a> 未完待续……</span></p><span></span><p><span>主持/选题/设计：杨光</span><br><span>主持/录音/制作：方舟</span><br><span>本期嘉宾：雨前羽街</span></p><span></span><p><span href="#t=38:42"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2322">38:42</a></span></span><span> 提到的纪录片</span><a href="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1Ga411w7vN" data-url="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1Ga411w7vN"><span>《中国之食文化》</span></a><span>；</span></p><span></span><p><span>你喜欢的烤鸭是什么样的？有没有推荐朋友的必去烤鸭店？还想听我们聊些什么美食？欢迎在评论区留言。</span></p><span></span><p><span>你也可以通过以下方式“捕捉”到我们：</span></p><span></span><p><span>微博：</span><a href="https://weibo.com/p/1005051362772654" data-url="https://weibo.com/p/1005051362772654"><span>@杨光_建厨师</span></a><span> </span><a href="https://weibo.com/p/1005053977660838" data-url="https://weibo.com/p/1005053977660838"><span>@线性方舟</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>光听不够，想</span><strong><span>看杨光一展身手</span></strong><span>，请直接小手轻点链接：</span><a href="https://space.bilibili.com/21950148" data-url="https://space.bilibili.com/21950148"><span>B站</span></a><span> </span><a href="https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCIB6FxDn7muqNdIIT3_nMXg/" data-url="https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCIB6FxDn7muqNdIIT3_nMXg/"><span>油管</span></a><span> 以及各大视频平台搜索“杨光_建厨师”；</span></p><span></span><p><span>随便</span><strong><span>听听方舟放音乐</span></strong><span>：</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/5f14330f6d7660742733a686?s=eyJ1IjogIjVlN2M2ZTRiYTJmMmU1MDNjZWMzOGJhYiJ9" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/5f14330f6d7660742733a686?s=eyJ1IjogIjVlN2M2ZTRiYTJmMmU1MDNjZWMzOGJhYiJ9"><span>小宇宙</span></a><span> </span><a href="https://music.163.com/radio/?id=794954379&amp;userid=284135502" data-url="https://music.163.com/radio/?id=794954379&amp;userid=284135502"><span>网易云</span></a><span> 以及各大播客平台搜索“周末变奏”；</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期嘉宾 </span><strong><span>雨前羽街</span></strong><span>：播客 </span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/5f292c4e9504bbdb771df09b?s=eyJ1IjogIjVlN2M2ZTRiYTJmMmU1MDNjZWMzOGJhYiJ9" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/5f292c4e9504bbdb771df09b?s=eyJ1IjogIjVlN2M2ZTRiYTJmMmU1MDNjZWMzOGJhYiJ9"><span>《饭不着》</span></a><span> 微博 </span><a href="https://weibo.com/p/1005051920022547" data-url="https://weibo.com/p/1005051920022547"><span>@雨前羽街</span></a></p>]]></description>
